OL,3,GNEWSAJurors unable to reach verdict for
OL,4,Afinal gas worker
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommissioner Andrew Oldland previously
OL,7,Ftold jurors he would accept a majority
OL,8,Fverdict Ward, the last remaining
OL,9,Fdefendant. The 12 jurors were
OL,10,Fdischarged from returning verdicts in
OL,11,Frespect of Ward on Thursday.
